    "title": "Bloodborne Comics EN",
    "description": "Bloodborne Comics totally in English    \r\n\r\nIf you are looking to have a good time and you are a lover of reading and the souls saga, we recommend these bloodborne comics so that you can immerse yourself in their fantasy world and enjoy as a true fan of history and the world that is hidden behind it. all those corridors, cathedrals, monsters, spells, witches and join the adventure of our hunters.\r\n\r\nWhile reading bloodborne comics we will immerse ourselves in a gloomy world where hunters must defeat enemies from nightmares and where the course of history will make us remember those moments in yharnam, the city where we enjoyed the video game.\r\n\r\nThese bloodborne comics consist of 16 chapters totally unrelated to the history of the saga but that still give a touch of fantasy to the world that we will visit in the form of illustration\r\n\r\nAnd the best of all is that with these comics you can use the images that you like the most from bloodborne as wallpaper and use it as custom themes.\r\n\r\nIf you are passionate about reading and especially comics, with this catalog you will enjoy the best volumes of dark fantasy comics where the creatures of the abyss will try to do everything possible to end your life, but the brave hunters will always be willing to fight to end your life. with these demonic beasts that ravage the landscapes of yharnam.\r\n\r\nThese comics are inspired by an exclusive From Software game, designed by Hidetaka Miyazaki, creator of Dark Souls and Demon's Souls.\r\n \r\nLike these, it is an action and role-playing title in which confrontations against complicated enemies that will put us in trouble prevail. The setting is between gothic and apocalyptic, taking us to a steampunk world with firearms and fantastic creatures.\r\n\r\nDevelopment\r\n\r\nThe title was announced just a few months before its release. The first rumors spoke of a game called Project Beast in May 2014. Weeks later it was presented at E3 as Bloodborne, to arrive in March 2015 as a great PS4 exclusive.\r\n\r\nHistory\r\n\r\nBloodborne takes us to the decrepit city of Yharnam, whose inhabitants have been infected by a mysterious blood disease. We play the 'Hunter', a character who will have to search for a mysterious substance called Pale Blood while solving mysteries and facing all kinds of creatures.\r\n\r\ncombat system\r\n\r\nIn the style of Demon's Souls and Dark Souls, since it is the work of the same creator, Bloodborne integrates a demanding combat system in which we have to cover ourselves from the blows of hard enemies and attack carefully so as not to spend our resistance prematurely.",
